sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Client / Browser
    participant API as Express Router & RateLimiter
    participant Ctrl as AuthController
    participant Svc as AuthService
    participant Model as UserModel (MongoDB)

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login { email, password }
    API->>API: Rate Limiter Check (<= 10 attempts/15m)
    API->>Ctrl: handleLogin(req, res)
    Ctrl->>Svc: authenticate(email, password)
    Svc->>Model: findOne({ email }).select('+passwordHash')
    Model-->>Svc: user record or null
    
    alt User not found or invalid password
        Svc-->>Ctrl: throw UnauthorizedError("Invalid email or password")
        Ctrl-->>User: 401 Unauthorized { success: false, error: ... }
    else Valid credentials
        Svc->>Svc: bcrypt.compare(password, passwordHash)
        Svc->>Svc: generateJwtToken(user)
        Svc-->>Ctrl: { userProfile, token }
        Ctrl->>User: Set-Cookie: token=JWT; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax; Secure<br/>200 OK { success: true, data: userProfile }
    end
